flowchart LR
    A[🌿 SelfWorkspace<br/><small>git worktree on a branch</small>]
    B[✏️ edit · test · commit]
    C[📬 SelfPropose<br/><small>pull request · public-text gate</small>]
    D{👤 You, in the chat}
    E[🔀 merge]
    F[🔁 SelfRebuild when idle<br/><small>git reset · preflight · restart</small>]
    G[⏪ rollback<br/><small>last known-good build</small>]
    H[✅ new build running]
    A --> B --> C --> D
    D -- approve --> E --> F
    D -- reject + reason --> A
    F -- preflight fails --> G
    F -- ok --> H
    classDef step fill:#16213a,stroke:#60a5fa,color:#e8efff
    classDef you fill:#1d1d1f,stroke:#e7e7e7,color:#f4f4f5,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef good fill:#1f2a1f,stroke:#4ade80,color:#e6ffe9
    classDef bad fill:#2a1a1a,stroke:#f87171,color:#ffe4e4
    class A,B,C,E,F step
    class D you
    class H good
    class G bad
